1
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:08,359
Dad!

2
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,359
Zihao.

3
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:16,519
Shoot. Kill him.

4
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:17,920
Dad.

5
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,120
Don't force me.

6
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:20,799
Shoot.

7
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:21,599
Shoot!

8
00:01:21,599 --> 00:01:22,239
Xie Zihao.

9
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,640
Drop the gun.

10
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,719
Xie Guanhong.

11
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:25,799
Let him go.

12
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:28,680
Dad...

13
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,120
Dad!

14
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,400
I...

15
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,239
Shoot.

16
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:37,560
It's so simple.

17
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,920
Kill him.

18
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,200
I'll go with you.

19
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:42,439
You can't kill anyone else, Dad.

20
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,760
Zihao!

21
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,239
Zihao, don't!

22
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,239
Don't!

23
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:50,079
Liang Zhiqiang is your real father!

24
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:57,079
Kill him!

25
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,519
Run!

26
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:05,560
Go!

27
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:06,599
Zihao!

28
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:07,959
Run!

29
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:08,319
Zihao!

30
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:08,879
Xie Guanhong!

31
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:09,520
Go!

32
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,520
Xie Guanhong!

33
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,479
Zihao!

34
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,840
Are you okay?

35
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:17,800
Zihao!

36
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,000
Are you okay, Zihao?

37
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,080
Stop!

38
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,280
Don't run!

39
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,639
On my turf,

40
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:24,319
you want to fight me?

41
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,240
You can't beat me.

42
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:47,759
Xie Guanhong, you're not human!

43
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,280
Yeah.

44
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:52,879
I'm not human!

45
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:58,919
You're not human!

46
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,319
Are you even human?!

47
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,599
You...

48
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,800
You murderer!

49
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,600
I'm a murderer!

50
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,600
I've killed so many people.

51
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,319
I have nightmares every night.

52
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,720
Kill me.

53
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,920
Avenge them!

54
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,480
I'm a murderer.

55
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,720
I'm beyond redemption.

56
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:43,360
I'm a monster.

57
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,160
Kill me.

58
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:47,959
Kill me.

59
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,519
Kill me!

60
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,199
A Qiang.

61
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,160
You've already done twenty years.

62
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,600
If you go back in,

63
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,639
you'll never get out.

64
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:57,319
You can't kill him.

65
00:04:57,839 --> 00:04:58,920
Kill me.

66
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,720
We'll become monsters together.

67
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:04,920
Come on, Liang Zhiqiang!

68
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,279
Shut the hell up!

69
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:09,399
Come on, kill me!

70
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,000
Don't!

71
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,600
What are you doing?

72
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,920
Why didn't you kill me?

73
00:06:00,319 --> 00:06:01,360
All my life,

74
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,759
my favorite thing was going out to fight.

75
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,879
Fighting to see who was more ruthless.

76
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:13,079
To see who could

77
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:15,199
be the last one standing.

78
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:16,959
For twenty years,

79
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,000
it's always been like this.

80
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,800
If you're not ruthless enough,

81
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,120
then you just die.

82
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,360
I kill people,

83
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,079
people kill me.

84
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,959
It's completely normal.

85
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,079
I hold no grudges.

86
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:54,600
And I have no regrets.

87
00:06:59,199 --> 00:07:00,600
But in my entire life,

88
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,639
there is only one person

89
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,360
I feel I've let down.

90
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:10,879
I feel like

91
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,160
I owe him.

92
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,120
That person is you,

93
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,879
Liang Zhiqiang.

94
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,399
Little Qiang.

95
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,000
Sometimes I really miss

96
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,480
when we were kids.

97
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,319
To be honest,

98
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,959
we were all there.

99
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,759
We took a boat from the fishing village

100
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,160
and came here.

101
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:05,079
I really never thought

102
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,279
things would end up like this.

103
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:56,080
The second Operation Portland Street was a massive success.

104
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,399
Harbor City and mainland police launched a joint strike,

105
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,320
successfully dismantling the United Righteous Group,

106
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,919
a criminal syndicate, formerly a triad.

107
00:09:03,039 --> 00:09:03,799
They successfully solved

108
00:09:03,799 --> 00:09:06,000
the case of the female teacher's fatal fall

109
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,919
and several other major crimes.

110
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,759
A series of gang-related violent incidents,

111
00:09:08,759 --> 00:09:10,399
including illegal loan sharks,

112
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:12,399
forced prostitution, captivity, extortion,

113
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:14,799
have all seen massive breakthroughs.

114
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,399
Most notably,

115
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:19,480
the police made a rare public disclosure

116
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,960
that members of the force are suspected of

117
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,399
shielding triad organizations.

118
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,639
Several police officers have been formally

119
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:26,000
charged by the Independent Commission Against Corruption.

120
00:09:26,279 --> 00:09:27,440
What a big fish.

121
00:09:28,519 --> 00:09:29,799
It took the bait.

122
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:35,840
Let's go.

123
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:37,720
Mainland police officials also spoke,

124
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:40,159
vowing to uphold Harbor City's stability,

125
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,720
and thoroughly eradicate criminal forces.

126
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,919
They stated mutual cooperation will deepen

127
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:46,000
to jointly safeguard law and order.

128
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,559
Good work.

129
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:49,279
Thank you, Sir.

130
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,399
Come on.

131
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,720
This shop has been open for a long time.

132
00:10:39,879 --> 00:10:41,159
Now it's being torn down.

133
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,440
It's good they're tearing it down.

134
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:45,120
Old things

135
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:47,480
should be torn down to build new ones.

136
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,639
Thanks.

137
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,159
We're leaving Harbor City.

138
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:05,679
I applied to schools abroad for Zihao.

139
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,440
Once we get there,

140
00:11:07,559 --> 00:11:10,279
I'll find a job after we settle in.

141
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,600
Don't worry.

142
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:17,919
Take care.

143
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,919
All the best.

144
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:36,039
Take care of yourself.

145
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:38,279
And take care of your mom.

146
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,519
One day,

147
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:22,240
I'll take back what I lost

148
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,039
with my own hands.

149
00:13:31,159 --> 00:13:31,919
Little Qiang.

150
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,879
Uncle told us to go move the fish.

151
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,720
Okay, coming!
